@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "SFR008: Request AML-Compliant Transaction Alerts" as SFR008
  usecase "AIFR006: Generate Investment Opportunity Analyses for Users" as AIFR006
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback on Recommendations and Insights" as CFR011

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data in a consolidated format.
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage system parameters to ensure compliance with regulations like Basel III.

  Client --> SFR008 : Receive alerts about potential fraud or unusual spending patterns based on AML requirements.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003 : Access predictive analytics for clients during consultations.
  
  System --> AIFR006 : Deliver investment opportunity analyses to users based on their risk profiles and market trends.
  
  Client --> CFR011 : Provide feedback to the system about recommendations or insights received.

}

@enduml